message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated manuscript."
title: "Postoperative Delirium two-axis model: APOE epsilon4 susceptibility and peripheral immune state axis - multi-omics integration and in-silico drug-repositioning reproducibility package"
abstract: "Analysis code and derived result tables for the integrated epigenomic (GSE330869, EPIC v2), transcriptomic (GSE163943), single-cell (GSE252572), GWAS (Armstrong et al., PLOS Medicine 2026), and LINCS L1000 in-silico drug-repositioning pipeline supporting a two-axis model of postoperative delirium: a constitutive APOE epsilon4 susceptibility axis and a modifiable peripheral immune activation state axis."
